  m_Name: bug-triage
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: GameTerms.Runtime::GameTerms.GlossaryTermAsset
  data:
    Id: bug-triage
    Term: Bug Triage
    Abbreviation: 
    Category: 7
    Difficulty: 1
    ShortDefinition: Reviewing, prioritizing, and assigning defects based on severity
      and impact.
    SimpleExplanation: Sorting bugs so the worst problems get fixed first.
    WhyItMatters: Good triage protects schedules and focuses engineering on player-facing
      risk.
    Example: A crash on boot is marked blocker while a rare VFX pop is deferred.
    CommonMistake: Prioritizing by who filed the bug instead of player impact and
      frequency.
    PracticePrompt: Triage ten open bugs into severity buckets with owners and target
      milestones.
    GameUses:
    - Sprint planning
    - Launch readiness
    - Live support
    RelatedTermIds:
    - test-plan
    - regression-testing
    - milestone
    Tags:
    - qa
    - process
    - priority
    Synonyms: []
